      "note": "For the crashing 9-byte UTF-8 pattern, the final byte `0xec` yields an approximate width of 3 while only one byte remains before `end`, so `PFETCH(c)` moves `p` past the logical regex end. Fixed commit `9cc2ff55a146b2b3e8c321a87920c0d39a2b2ba6` repairs this exact omission by inserting `if (p > end) return ONIGERR_PREMATURE_END_OF_CHAR_CLASS;` immediately after `PFETCH(c);`.",
