      "note": "AddressSanitizer reports the crashing project frame as `onig_node_str_cat` and the call chain `onig_node_str_cat -> parse_exp -> parse_branch`. The saved trace does not symbolize the exact copy line inside the function, so this sink anchors the shared copy block at lines 1378-1405. On the staged witness, `str_to_regex()` passed a 9-byte logical payload inside a 26-byte SDS allocation, and the overrun token span extends beyond that 9-byte end. `onig_strcpy(..., s, end)` therefore performs the observed `READ of size 3` on a copy that straddles the payload boundary inside the SDS allocation.",
